freebuff-desktop (0.0.204-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * chrome-sandbox: promote it to 4755 at package build time like the
    heroic/stoat recipes; the payload ships it 0755 root:root with no
    fallback, so on kernels without unprivileged user namespaces the
    sandbox never launches.

